<title>SINGAPORE: Amtek full year net rises 47 percent.</title>
<headline>Amtek full year net rises 47 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     21.60 vs  14.65</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			1.50 vs   1.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    15.16 vs  10.30</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)  14.96 vs  10.28</p>
<p>    Turnover				251.54 vs 197.05</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.45 vs   0.57</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	     1.38 vs   0.36</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 30.79 vs  21.43</p>
<p>    Tax					 7.03 vs   4.81</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (loss) 2.16 vs   1.97 (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		(loss) 0.69 vs   0.07 (gain)</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: To be announced.</p>
<p>Note - Amtek Engineering Ltd said sales and profits grew in spite of competitive markets.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
